{
    "_doc": "Session commands of Job_MediaSession (a group movie / game session - RecreationActivity.requireMedia, Docs/Utnapishtim_Activities/Plan_UtnapishtimActivities.md). Each package is a short round (timeScale, no repeat) shared by one group of the activity (Docs/Activities/Plan_MediaSessionSharedPackage.md): the movie's progress is the job's own state, and anyone can break for a need and rejoin a later round. No doer cap (no doerCount); everyone is a doer (treatReceiverAsDoer), so watching together counts as an interaction. Like every activity package, the player's package holds their target / followers too (Job_Activity.CompanionsFor), each answering for themselves - a refusing one leaves, the player goes on. Silent: no begin / ongoing / remove / after lines, so a session of several hours doesn't flood the log (the session's own start / end events tell the story). Not furniture commands (no 'furniture' tag) - never offered by furniture to the ordinary sandbox.",
